      "confidence": "high",
      "rationale": "The medial head is active in nearly all elbow extension, including light loads, which makes it a major extender. Its deep fibres (articularis cubiti) tension the posterior elbow capsule. It does not cross the shoulder.",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
